  {
   "id": "t-kej6qdc0-nhbc",
   "updated": "2026-10-18T02:42:42.404Z",
   "title": "Detoured Highline: Red Castle → Hessie",
   "planned": false,
   "date": "2020-08-30",
   "end_date": "2020-09-06",
   "when": null,
   "body": "Our re-routed Highline attempt, with Dilworth for the first half, and Hui joined us from Kings Peak on.\n\nG-49: Caught three trout species here. Wonderful little break on our sidehilling off-trailing slog from East Red Castle on our way up to Red Castle. I followed the stream for most of it and caught at least one out of there.\n\nRed Castle (G-15): Magical couple of days here partway through our re-routed Highline attempt, with Dilworth and Hui.\n\nHessie (G-18): Camped on the east side overnight w/ John and Hui, as part of detoured Highline. Caught one nice one and saw some very big ones over on the west side.",
   "lakes": [
    "G-49",
    "G-15",
    "G-18",
    "WR-7",
    "G-14"
   ],
   "links": []
  },
  {
