  },
  {
   "id": "t-lzaieio0-4v0n",
   "updated": "2026-10-17T20:48:01.243Z",
   "title": "Red Castle w/ Dilworth + Ryan",
   "planned": false,
   "date": "2024-08-01",
   "end_date": "2026-10-03",
   "when": null,
   "body": "Red Castle (G-15): Dilworth and Ryan and I had repeated success with cutthroats in that little outlet pond, and I caught a few from my packraft out in the middle.\n\nG-49: Camped right nearby on the first night. Saw some rising but didn’t catch any that evening, but did see a bull, cow, and calf moose!\n\nSpent 2nd night camped by G-53. A million hungry tiny brookies. Our off trail to get there sucked and was better on the way out.",
   "lakes": [
    "G-15",
    "G-49",
    "G-53",
    "G-16"
   ],
   "links": []
  },
  {
